    },
    {
      "id": "C03-S01-U21",
      "role": "client",
      "text": "嗯……放一放，行吧。明天反正还得接着看，到时候再看吧。\n\n……谢谢。",
      "call_id": "b8cd9c8d4498458bb6a393e7df275805",
      "response_id": "resp_be89fb8d-5ff5-9058-8a8a-f0983301cbd5",
